<title>UK: New Asian hires at Caspian Securities in London.</title>
<headline>New Asian hires at Caspian Securities in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities Limited has appointed a new Asian Chief Economist and Asia strategist in London, both hired from Baclays de Zoete Wedd (BZW).</p>
<p>A statement from Caspian said Andrew Brick will become Chief Economist, Asia and David Shairp would join as Asia strategist.</p>
<p>Francois Gour is also joining Caspian as senior strategist for Latin America, from Credit Lyonnais in New York.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
